%% Functional Specification Diagram: AI Dialer System
flowchart TD
    A[Start: Customer's Phone Dialed by AI]
    B{Customer Answers?}
    C[Request for Clarification or Retry Up to 3 Times]
    D{Interested in Offer?}
    E[Transfer Call to Human Agent]
    F[Log Errors and End Call]
    G[Retry Offering up to 3 Times if Necessary]
    H[Close Call Successfully]

    A --> B
    B -->|Yes| C
    B -->|No| F
    C --> D
    D -->|Yes| E
    D -->|No| G
    G --> F
    E --> H
    H --> F
```